    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd><mtd><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd><mtd><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
